{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a lost soul wandering through the ruins of a long forgotten society. You and up to seven other friends are tasked with protecting Jane, a young woman trapped in a perpetual cycle of death and rebirth.  Use powerful spells and weapons to fight your way through the stronghold to uncover ancient knowledge and meet a powerful\u00a0deity held deep within its chambers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather a team of 8 souls controlling one vessel and face unknowable dangers in this cooperative turn-based dungeon crawler. Collect unique skill and spell cards that will aid you and your team in combat. Each card provides a unique benefit, granting useful buffs to one of your friends, weakening an enemy, mending your teammates wounds and damaging monsters that block your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coordination and cooperation is important for success, maybe you have a party member that specializes entirely on damage, maybe they could use a little bit of healing every now and then! You may even a whole team of casters that needs a quick boost to their spells, or you could all focus on making one party member a powerhouse capable of annihilating anything in their path!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3661160?t=1752356855","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3661160?t=1752356855","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661160/61e92629ee618c64c35697ec5e828697fb4fd5cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752356855","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661160/61e92629ee618c64c35697ec5e828697fb4fd5cf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752356855","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Themes of suicide and self harm\r\nSuggestive content\r\nMild violence\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a lost soul wandering through the ruins of a long forgotten society. You and up to seven other friends are tasked with protecting Jane, a young woman trapped in a perpetual cycle of death and rebirth.  Use powerful spells and weapons to fight your way through the stronghold to uncover ancient knowledge and meet a powerful\u00a0deity held deep within its chambers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather a team of 8 souls controlling one vessel and face unknowable dangers in this cooperative turn-based dungeon crawler. Collect unique skill and spell cards that will aid you and your team in combat. Each card provides a unique benefit, granting useful buffs to one of your friends, weakening an enemy, mending your teammates wounds and damaging monsters that block your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Coordination and cooperation is important for success, maybe you have a party member that specializes entirely on damage, maybe they could use a little bit of healing every now and then! You may even a whole team of casters that needs a quick boost to their spells, or you could all focus on making one party member a powerhouse capable of annihilating anything in their path!</p>","developers":["camphii_"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661160/7d6c25060f68dbb1042ec1cff59022000841e98c/header.jpg?t=1752356855","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Darkest Descent","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit processor and operating system<br><